    753  25cb							;-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    754  25cb							; Enemies: half of them each frame (even slots on even frames, odd slots on
    755  25cb							; odd frames), so each moves in steps of two frames. Each walks left at its
    756  25cb							; kind's pace; a toy in its way stops it and gets chewed, except: the
    757  25cb							; helicopter hops over the first toy, the pogo frog jumps to the next shelf
    758  25cb							; once, the balloon clown floats over every toy, the T-Rex crushes a toy in
    759  25cb							; one bite. A lasso holds it; reaching the toy box is a breach.
